upgrade:
  - sdk:
      id: aiml
      version: "3.0.0"
    component:
      - script: scripts/upgrade_add_ml_model.lua
        description: |
          Adds ml_model to every upgraded project.
      - trigger:
          id: tensorflow_lite_micro
        description: |
          Removes tensorflow_lite_micro; ml_model is added by default and pulls in the runtime as a dependency.
          1. Use sl_ml_model_init, sl_ml_model_run, and sl_ml_model_deinit on sl_ml_<model>_model_handle from sl_ml_model_<model>.h.
          2. Replace slx_ml_<model>_model_init/run or sl_tflite_micro_init / sl_tflite_micro_get_input_tensor as needed.
          3. Regenerate the project.
          4. For this upgrade to go through, please use the "Force Upgrade" option.
        status: impossible
        remove:
          - id: tensorflow_lite_micro
      - trigger:
          id: nn_util
          package: compute
          vendor: silabs
        description: nn_util moved to aiml; replacing compute nn_util with aiml nn_util.
        status: automatic
        remove:
          - id: nn_util
            package: compute
            vendor: silabs
        add:
          - id: nn_util
      - trigger:
          id: nn_mvp
          package: compute
          vendor: silabs
        description: nn_mvp moved to aiml; replacing compute nn_mvp with aiml nn_mvp.
        status: automatic
        remove:
          - id: nn_mvp
            package: compute
            vendor: silabs
        add:
          - id: nn_mvp
      - trigger:
          id: mvp
          package: compute
          vendor: silabs
        description: |
          Legacy compute mvp required nn_mvp; math_mvp does not. Add aiml nn_mvp when
          upgrading projects that used compute mvp for ML acceleration.
        status: automatic
        add:
          - id: nn_mvp
      - trigger:
          id: tensorflow_lite_micro_accelerated_kernels
        description: Adds aiml nn_util and nn_mvp required by MVP-accelerated kernels.
        status: automatic
        add:
          - id: nn_util
          - id: nn_mvp
      - trigger:
          id: ml_audio_feature_generation
        description: Renamed to fe_audio. Si91x uses sl_ml_audio_feature_generation_init(&sl_fe_audio_<model>_cfg).
        status: automatic
        remove:
          - id: ml_audio_feature_generation
        add:
          - id: fe_audio
  - sdk:
      id: aiml
      version: 3.0.1
    component:
      - trigger: fe_audio
        description: |
          Audio feature generator now uses per-instance config (aiml 3.0.1).

          EFR32:
          1. Include sl_fe_audio_instances.h.
          2. Replace sl_ml_audio_feature_generation_init() with
             sl_ml_audio_feature_generation_init(&sl_fe_audio_<instance>_cfg).
          3. Replace sl_ml_audio_feature_generation_frontend_init() with
             sl_ml_audio_feature_generation_frontend_init(config).

          All platforms (EFR + Si91x):
          4. Remove calls to sl_ml_audio_feature_generation_load_model_settings().
          5. Remove sl_ml_audio_feature_generation_config.h from your application;
             use sl_fe_audio_<instance>_config.h instead (already in your project).
          6. Replace SL_ML_FRONTEND_ACTIVITY_DETECTION_ENABLE with
             sl_ml_audio_feature_generation_is_activity_detection_enabled() (Si91x).
          7. Replace any SL_ML_FRONTEND_* or SL_ML_AUDIO_FEATURE_GENERATION_* macros
             with the matching SL_FE_* macros in sl_fe_audio_<instance>_config.h.

          <instance> is the name chosen for each fe_audio component instance.
        status: user_verification
